<th><strong>Quiz</strong></th>
<th><strong>Project</strong></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr class="odd">
<td>1. Clarify requirements</td>
<td>Q1</td>
<td>Stage 1</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even">
<td>2. Research and plan solution</td>
<td>Q2, Q3, Q5</td>
<td>Stages 1-2 + justification</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd">
<td>3. Install/configure equipment/services</td>
<td>Q9-Q11</td>
<td>Stage 3</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even">
<td>4. Protocols and IP addressing</td>
<td>Q2, Q4, Q6-Q7, Q18</td>
<td>Stages 2-3</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd">
<td>5. Network security</td>
<td>Q12-Q14</td>
<td>Stages 2-3</td>
</tr>
<tr class="even">
<td>6. Test/validate connectivity and protocols</td>
<td>Q15-Q16</td>
<td>Stages 2-4 + test plan/results</td>
</tr>
<tr class="odd">
